{
 "_comment": "THE FACILITY (FacilityManager): the slaughterhouse-turned-studio around the table, walked in real time (the LCC building: data/hall/*.json). Getting up costs suspicion; the board doesn't wait; the return timer runs; when it runs out the Caller decides what to do about you (CallerResponseManager). Each interactable: where (hall metres x,z), its area, reach r, its actions. Action: ok/caught = suspicion if fine / if seen; effect; once (per match) | per_round | cost (Teeth) | needs (an item) | needs_flag (facility state) | hidden_until (a flag). Areas out of the hall are out of his sight: he only catches you there on a 'camera' roll. 'locks': doors that need a facility flag before they open (everything else opens).",
